[{"text": "Hello, everyone. Welcome to another great lesson with us here at EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 0.0, "end": 6.0600000000000005}, {"text": "And I'm Erica.", "start": 6.36, "end": 7.0}, {"text": "And today we're going to be talking about an ER, an emergency room.", "start": 7.4, "end": 11.36}, {"text": "Exactly. We're bringing you our very own ER drama here at EnglishPod.", "start": 11.5, "end": 15.26}, {"text": "Yeah, doctor shows are very popular with people, medical terms and all that stuff.", "start": 15.82, "end": 20.580000000000002}, {"text": "Yeah, so we're going to teach you some words that you might hear commonly in medical shows on TV or in movies.", "start": 20.78, "end": 26.94}, {"text": "This is really common language in television.", "start": 27.34, "end": 29.560000000000002}, {"text": "Or even at a hospital, right?", "start": 29.56, "end": 30.86}, {"text": "Well, yeah. But let's hope our listeners don't have to face this.", "start": 31.02, "end": 34.14}, {"text": "Okay, so let's preview some words in Vocabulary Preview.", "start": 34.36, "end": 36.8}, {"text": "Vocabulary Preview.", "start": 37.82, "end": 38.98}, {"text": "All right, so what's our first word?", "start": 39.8, "end": 41.3}, {"text": "Okay, the first word is CPR.", "start": 41.78, "end": 43.94}, {"text": "CPR.", "start": 44.68, "end": 45.16}, {"text": "CPR.", "start": 45.599999999999994, "end": 46.0}, {"text": "So that's pretty easy. What does that mean?", "start": 46.36, "end": 47.9}, {"text": "Well, it's short for cardiopulmonary resuscitation.", "start": 48.58, "end": 52.68}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 53.18, "end": 53.66}, {"text": "If that means anything to you.", "start": 54.0, "end": 55.599999999999994}, {"text": "Well, cardio is related to the heart.", "start": 56.3, "end": 58.28}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 58.28, "end": 58.92}, {"text": "Pulmonary refers to the lungs.", "start": 58.92, "end": 60.88}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 61.1, "end": 61.24}, {"text": "Resuscitation means to come back to life.", "start": 62.02, "end": 64.46000000000001}, {"text": "Yes. So basically CPR is, you know when someone stops breathing?", "start": 64.68, "end": 69.28}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 69.52, "end": 69.8}, {"text": "You put your mouth on their mouth and you breathe inside their lungs.", "start": 69.94, "end": 73.0}, {"text": "Okay, to give them air.", "start": 73.14, "end": 74.12}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 74.3, "end": 74.64}, {"text": "Oh, okay.", "start": 75.06, "end": 75.7}, {"text": "So CPR.", "start": 76.18, "end": 76.92}, {"text": "That's CPR.", "start": 77.12, "end": 77.88}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 78.22, "end": 78.58}, {"text": "Okay. So let's take a look at our next word. BP.", "start": 78.58, "end": 80.96}, {"text": "BP.", "start": 81.44, "end": 81.8}, {"text": "So BP is short for?", "start": 82.44, "end": 84.06}, {"text": "Blood pressure.", "start": 84.24, "end": 84.84}, {"text": "Blood pressure.", "start": 84.84, "end": 85.4}, {"text": "That's just the way that doctors use it in the emergency room.", "start": 85.52, "end": 88.8}, {"text": "Exactly. Pretty simple.", "start": 88.88, "end": 89.8}, {"text": "Okay, so blood pressure.", "start": 90.14, "end": 91.32}, {"text": "And our last word.", "start": 92.0, "end": 93.08}, {"text": "Acute respiratory failure.", "start": 93.44, "end": 95.34}, {"text": "Acute respiratory failure.", "start": 95.34, "end": 96.96000000000001}, {"text": "So what is that exactly? That sounds complicated.", "start": 97.3, "end": 99.9}, {"text": "Basically, it's really serious.", "start": 99.9, "end": 103.64}, {"text": "They stop breathing.", "start": 104.32000000000001, "end": 105.10000000000001}, {"text": "You stop breathing.", "start": 105.36, "end": 106.22}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 106.34, "end": 106.48}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 106.76, "end": 107.18}, {"text": "So if you go into acute respiratory failure, then the doctor or somebody has to perform CPR.", "start": 107.44000000000001, "end": 113.16000000000001}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 113.62, "end": 113.94000000000001}, {"text": "All right. Cool.", "start": 114.24, "end": 115.1}, {"text": "Okay, so we've previewed these three great words.", "start": 115.84, "end": 118.82}, {"text": "Now let's listen to our dialogue for the first time.", "start": 118.94, "end": 121.16}, {"text": "It's going to be really fast and you're going to have a lot of drama in it.", "start": 121.42, "end": 124.56}, {"text": "So don't worry if you don't understand everything.", "start": 124.67999999999999, "end": 127.0}, {"text": "Yeah, we're going to come back and teach you some of the important language.", "start": 127.14, "end": 130.0}, {"text": "Help! Are you a doctor?", "start": 141.48, "end": 143.12}, {"text": "My poor little Frankie has just stopped breathing.", "start": 143.94, "end": 146.0}, {"text": "Oh my gosh, help me.", "start": 146.34, "end": 147.64}, {"text": "I tried to perform CPR, but I just, I don't know if I could get any air into his lungs.", "start": 148.02, "end": 151.85999999999999}, {"text": "Oh, Frankie.", "start": 152.0, "end": 152.84}, {"text": "Ellen, get him hooked up to a monitor.", "start": 153.88, "end": 155.72}, {"text": "Somebody page Dr. Hauser.", "start": 156.3, "end": 157.48}, {"text": "Get the patient hold still.", "start": 158.1, "end": 159.06}, {"text": "I can't get a pulse.", "start": 160.16, "end": 161.16}, {"text": "Okay, he's on the monitor.", "start": 163.38, "end": 164.48}, {"text": "His BP's falling.", "start": 165.12, "end": 165.9}, {"text": "He's flatlining.", "start": 166.46, "end": 167.07999999999998}, {"text": "No! Frankie!", "start": 167.5, "end": 169.52}, {"text": "Doctor, do something!", "start": 170.36, "end": 171.6}, {"text": "Someone get her out of here.", "start": 172.68, "end": 173.84}, {"text": "Get me the defibrillator.", "start": 173.94, "end": 175.56}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 176.18, "end": 176.42}, {"text": "Clear.", "start": 177.12, "end": 177.48}, {"text": "Again, clear.", "start": 179.02, "end": 179.88}, {"text": "Come on, dammit, I'm not letting go of you.", "start": 181.22, "end": 182.85999999999999}, {"text": "Clear!", "start": 183.3, "end": 183.74}, {"text": "I got a pulse.", "start": 185.32, "end": 186.12}, {"text": "Okay, what's happening?", "start": 186.72, "end": 187.72}, {"text": "Patient is in acute respiratory failure.", "start": 188.22, "end": 190.1}, {"text": "I think we're going to have to intubate.", "start": 190.18, "end": 191.52}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 191.52, "end": 192.76000000000002}, {"text": "", "start": 192.76000000000002, "end": 192.76000000000002}, {"text": "Tube's in.", "start": 193.04000000000002, "end": 193.58}, {"text": "Bag him.", "start": 193.8, "end": 194.14000000000001}, {"text": "Somebody give him 10 cc shot of adrenaline.", "start": 194.44, "end": 196.36}, {"text": "Let's go, people.", "start": 196.78, "end": 197.72}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 197.86, "end": 198.26000000000002}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 198.44, "end": 198.70000000000002}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 198.70000000000002, "end": 198.88000000000002}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 205.46, "end": 206.02}, {"text": "Oh, thank God!", "start": 206.3, "end": 207.48000000000002}, {"text": "How is he?", "start": 207.48, "end": 208.84}, {"text": "We've managed to stabilize Frankie, but he's not out of the woods yet.", "start": 208.84, "end": 213.23999999999998}, {"text": "He's still in critical condition.", "start": 213.82, "end": 215.35999999999999}, {"text": "We're moving him to intensive care, but...", "start": 216.07999999999998, "end": 218.23999999999998}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 218.23999999999998, "end": 218.6}, {"text": "Just do whatever it takes.", "start": 219.14, "end": 221.12}, {"text": "I just want my little Frankie to be okay.", "start": 221.44, "end": 223.26}, {"text": "I couldn't imagine life without my little hamster.", "start": 223.89999999999998, "end": 226.92}, {"text": "Wow, so much drama over a little hamster.", "start": 226.92, "end": 236.92}, {"text": "Yeah, a little pet, eh?", "start": 237.07999999999998, "end": 238.06}, {"text": "A little pet, the little hamster.", "start": 238.07999999999998, "end": 239.6}, {"text": "Well, you know what?", "start": 239.92, "end": 241.01999999999998}, {"text": "I can relate to this owner, and I'm going to tell you a little bit more about that later.", "start": 241.01999999999998, "end": 245.39999999999998}, {"text": "Yeah, I know you have a really good story about this.", "start": 245.51999999999998, "end": 247.44}, {"text": "Yeah, but in the meantime, let's look at some great language in Language Takeaway.", "start": 247.45999999999998, "end": 251.11999999999998}, {"text": "Language Takeaway.", "start": 252.73999999999998, "end": 253.83999999999997}, {"text": "All right, so let's take a look at our first word.", "start": 253.84, "end": 257.82}, {"text": "Intubate.", "start": 258.66, "end": 259.18}, {"text": "Intubate.", "start": 259.78000000000003, "end": 260.3}, {"text": "Intubate.", "start": 260.72, "end": 261.24}, {"text": "Intubate.", "start": 261.96, "end": 262.48}, {"text": "So this is a medical procedure.", "start": 262.7, "end": 264.3}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 264.58, "end": 265.0}, {"text": "When a patient can't breathe properly, sometimes the doctor takes a long tube and puts it into", "start": 265.64, "end": 271.78000000000003}, {"text": "their mouth and down their pipes, I guess, down their breathing tube.", "start": 271.78000000000003, "end": 275.98}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 276.1, "end": 276.38}, {"text": "So that they can breathe better.", "start": 276.48, "end": 277.6}, {"text": "Okay, so that's to intubate.", "start": 278.02, "end": 280.14}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 280.3, "end": 280.5}, {"text": "Okay, so once they've intubated the patient, they start to bag him.", "start": 280.5, "end": 285.02}, {"text": "Yeah, bag him.", "start": 285.16, "end": 286.26}, {"text": "Bag him.", "start": 286.52, "end": 287.14}, {"text": "Bag him.", "start": 287.34, "end": 287.76}, {"text": "Does that mean they, like, put a bag over the person's head or something?", "start": 287.8, "end": 290.62}, {"text": "No, no, no, no, no.", "start": 290.72, "end": 290.86}, {"text": "So there's a bag attached to this intubation tube, and you squeeze it to put air into the", "start": 291.24, "end": 296.8}, {"text": "lungs.", "start": 296.8, "end": 297.04}, {"text": "Okay, so you squeeze this bag, and it puts air through the tube.", "start": 297.14, "end": 301.42}, {"text": "I think this is just medical slang.", "start": 301.54, "end": 303.2}, {"text": "Yeah, I guess bag him.", "start": 303.68, "end": 304.78}, {"text": "Yeah, but you hear it all the time on TV, so it's important our listeners know it.", "start": 304.78, "end": 308.32}, {"text": "Okay, let's look at our next word.", "start": 308.32, "end": 310.44}, {"text": "Critical condition.", "start": 310.64, "end": 311.59999999999997}, {"text": "Critical condition.", "start": 311.9, "end": 312.74}, {"text": "Critical condition.", "start": 313.09999999999997, "end": 314.3}, {"text": "The patient's in critical condition.", "start": 314.5, "end": 316.26}, {"text": "This condition means it's serious.", "start": 316.68, "end": 318.52}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 318.88, "end": 319.15999999999997}, {"text": "If a patient is in critical condition, they're either really, really hurt or really, really", "start": 319.26, "end": 324.82}, {"text": "sick, and they could die pretty soon.", "start": 324.82, "end": 327.02}, {"text": "Okay, so you don't want to be in critical condition.", "start": 327.1, "end": 330.14}, {"text": "No.", "start": 330.21999999999997, "end": 330.52}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our next word.", "start": 330.52, "end": 332.46}, {"text": "Stabilize.", "start": 333.18, "end": 333.62}, {"text": "Stabilize.", "start": 334.21999999999997, "end": 334.65999999999997}, {"text": "Stabilize.", "start": 335.41999999999996, "end": 335.85999999999996}, {"text": "Stabilize.", "start": 336.26, "end": 336.7}, {"text": "So when the doctors stabilize a patient, they take that patient out of danger.", "start": 336.88, "end": 341.0}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 341.32, "end": 341.7}, {"text": "When a patient is stabilized, they probably won't die in five minutes.", "start": 341.88, "end": 346.65999999999997}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 346.85999999999996, "end": 347.15999999999997}, {"text": "But they could still be really sick.", "start": 347.34, "end": 348.9}, {"text": "They could be in critical condition, right?", "start": 348.97999999999996, "end": 350.84}, {"text": "But it's under control.", "start": 350.91999999999996, "end": 351.79999999999995}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 352.08, "end": 352.47999999999996}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 352.65999999999997, "end": 352.97999999999996}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 353.15999999999997, "end": 353.38}, {"text": "Stabilize.", "start": 354.02, "end": 354.46}, {"text": "Let's look at our last word.", "start": 354.84, "end": 356.15999999999997}, {"text": "ICU.", "start": 356.71999999999997, "end": 357.0}, {"text": "ICU.", "start": 358.06, "end": 358.41999999999996}, {"text": "ICU.", "start": 358.42, "end": 358.7}, {"text": "ICU.", "start": 359.14000000000004, "end": 359.5}, {"text": "Intensive care unit.", "start": 360.08000000000004, "end": 361.2}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 361.48, "end": 361.82}, {"text": "That's what it means.", "start": 361.98, "end": 362.72}, {"text": "Intensive care unit.", "start": 363.04, "end": 364.36}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 364.5, "end": 364.68}, {"text": "So that's the place where patients who are in critical condition are taken.", "start": 364.82, "end": 368.34000000000003}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 368.74, "end": 369.06}, {"text": "So what's the difference between an ICU and a regular room?", "start": 369.40000000000003, "end": 372.32}, {"text": "Well, I don't know.", "start": 372.64000000000004, "end": 373.40000000000003}, {"text": "I've never been in one.", "start": 373.44, "end": 374.16}, {"text": "But I think patients are monitored regularly, and I think there's maybe more nurses and fewer", "start": 374.68, "end": 383.40000000000003}, {"text": "patients.", "start": 383.40000000000003, "end": 383.88}, {"text": "There's just a higher level of care.", "start": 384.22, "end": 385.76}, {"text": "A higher level of care.", "start": 385.94, "end": 386.98}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 387.08000000000004, "end": 387.26}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 387.66, "end": 388.1}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 388.42, "end": 389.02000000000004}, {"text": "So it's time for us to listen to our dialogue again.", "start": 389.12, "end": 391.18}, {"text": "Now try to catch all of these medical terms that we've just talked about, and then we'll", "start": 391.32, "end": 395.7}, {"text": "come back and explain a few phrases.", "start": 395.7, "end": 397.0}, {"text": "Help!", "start": 400.82, "end": 401.18}, {"text": "Are you a doctor?", "start": 401.48, "end": 402.40000000000003}, {"text": "My poor little Frankie has just stopped breathing.", "start": 403.02000000000004, "end": 405.28000000000003}, {"text": "Oh my gosh, help me.", "start": 405.76, "end": 406.92}, {"text": "I tried to perform CPR, but I just, I don't know if I could get any air into his lungs.", "start": 407.32, "end": 411.14}, {"text": "Oh, Frankie!", "start": 411.28000000000003, "end": 412.1}, {"text": "Ellen, get him hooked up to a monitor.", "start": 413.20000000000005, "end": 415.0}, {"text": "Somebody page Dr. Hauser.", "start": 415.6, "end": 416.76}, {"text": "Get the patient hold still.", "start": 416.76, "end": 418.36}, {"text": "I can't get a pulse.", "start": 419.4, "end": 420.44}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 421.65999999999997, "end": 422.08}, {"text": "He's on the monitor.", "start": 422.14, "end": 422.78}, {"text": "His BP's falling.", "start": 423.34, "end": 424.21999999999997}, {"text": "He's flatlining.", "start": 424.74, "end": 425.4}, {"text": "No!", "start": 425.4, "end": 426.08}, {"text": "Frankie!", "start": 427.36, "end": 427.84}, {"text": "Doctor, do something!", "start": 428.58, "end": 429.92}, {"text": "Someone get her out of here.", "start": 431.92, "end": 433.09999999999997}, {"text": "Get me the defibrillator.", "start": 433.65999999999997, "end": 434.8}, {"text": "Clear.", "start": 434.8, "end": 434.84000000000003}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 435.34000000000003, "end": 435.7}, {"text": "Clear?", "start": 436.3, "end": 436.72}, {"text": "Again, clear?", "start": 438.28000000000003, "end": 439.1}, {"text": "Come on, dammit.", "start": 440.48, "end": 441.32}, {"text": "I'm not letting go of you.", "start": 441.36, "end": 442.1}, {"text": "Clear!", "start": 442.6, "end": 442.96000000000004}, {"text": "I've got a pulse.", "start": 444.52000000000004, "end": 445.34000000000003}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 446.02000000000004, "end": 446.36}, {"text": "What's happening?", "start": 446.48, "end": 446.94}, {"text": "The patient is in acute respiratory failure.", "start": 447.46, "end": 449.34}, {"text": "I think we're going to have to intubate.", "start": 449.44, "end": 450.82}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 451.54, "end": 452.02}, {"text": "Tube's in.", "start": 452.26, "end": 452.84}, {"text": "Bag him.", "start": 453.06, "end": 453.38}, {"text": "Somebody give him 10 cc's shot of adrenaline.", "start": 453.68, "end": 455.58}, {"text": "Let's go, people!", "start": 456.0, "end": 456.96}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 457.1, "end": 457.54}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 457.66, "end": 457.92}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 459.26, "end": 459.78}, {"text": "Oh, thank God!", "start": 460.0, "end": 461.16}, {"text": "How is he?", "start": 461.4, "end": 462.54}, {"text": "We've managed to stabilize Frankie, but he's not out of the woods yet.", "start": 463.34, "end": 466.92}, {"text": "He's still in critical condition.", "start": 467.54, "end": 469.04}, {"text": "We're moving him to intensive care, but...", "start": 469.62, "end": 471.86}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 471.86, "end": 472.3}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 472.3, "end": 472.38}, {"text": "Just do whatever it takes.", "start": 473.04, "end": 474.84000000000003}, {"text": "I just want my little Frankie to be okay.", "start": 475.14, "end": 477.0}, {"text": "I couldn't imagine life without my little hamster.", "start": 477.40000000000003, "end": 480.66}, {"text": "Okay, so there are some really good phrasal verbs in this dialogue.", "start": 484.90000000000003, "end": 488.3}, {"text": "Yeah, a couple of good phrasal verbs.", "start": 488.42, "end": 489.92}, {"text": "Okay, so let's take a look at these phrasal verbs in Putting It Together.", "start": 490.04, "end": 493.2}, {"text": "Putting It Together.", "start": 495.02, "end": 496.06}, {"text": "All right, so what's our first phrasal verb today?", "start": 497.56, "end": 500.58000000000004}, {"text": "Hook up.", "start": 501.02, "end": 501.74}, {"text": "Hook up.", "start": 501.74, "end": 502.62}, {"text": "Hook up.", "start": 502.8, "end": 503.46000000000004}, {"text": "So, to hook up.", "start": 503.92, "end": 505.44}, {"text": "So, when we talk about hooking something up, we are usually talking about electronics, right, Marco?", "start": 505.58, "end": 512.04}, {"text": "Yeah, you usually hook up your TV or your computer.", "start": 512.3, "end": 514.76}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 515.04, "end": 515.16}, {"text": "So, why don't we listen to some examples of how we would use hook up.", "start": 515.6, "end": 518.6800000000001}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 520.0, "end": 520.86}, {"text": "I finally got a Nintendo Wii!", "start": 523.1, "end": 525.2}, {"text": "Come on, help me hook it up to the TV.", "start": 525.6, "end": 527.58}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 530.8, "end": 531.6}, {"text": "I don't know how to hook up this new DVD player.", "start": 531.74, "end": 537.5600000000001}, {"text": "Can you help me?", "start": 537.72, "end": 538.46}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 542.34, "end": 543.12}, {"text": "I just hooked up my new HDTV.", "start": 546.62, "end": 549.52}, {"text": "Want to come over and watch a movie?", "start": 549.92, "end": 551.5600000000001}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 551.56, "end": 552.0999999999999}, {"text": "", "start": 552.0999999999999, "end": 552.0999999999999}, {"text": "So, you can see that there are a few different variations of this pattern here with the word hook up because it's a phrasal verb.", "start": 552.0999999999999, "end": 561.92}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 561.92, "end": 562.5799999999999}, {"text": "And I think the same patterns can apply to our next phrasal verb.", "start": 562.92, "end": 566.62}, {"text": "Hold still.", "start": 567.3199999999999, "end": 568.0999999999999}, {"text": "Hold still.", "start": 568.3, "end": 569.14}, {"text": "Hold still.", "start": 569.4, "end": 570.5799999999999}, {"text": "Hold still.", "start": 570.78, "end": 571.36}, {"text": "So, the doctor needed the patient to hold still.", "start": 571.7199999999999, "end": 574.56}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 574.7199999999999, "end": 574.9599999999999}, {"text": "To stop moving.", "start": 575.0999999999999, "end": 575.9399999999999}, {"text": "Stop moving.", "start": 576.1999999999999, "end": 577.04}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 577.12, "end": 577.52}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 577.52, "end": 578.34}, {"text": "Let's listen to some more examples of hold still because, again, it's a really great phrasal verb that you can change up a little bit.", "start": 578.34, "end": 584.28}, {"text": "Good call.", "start": 584.28, "end": 585.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 585.86, "end": 586.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 586.48, "end": 586.8}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 586.9399999999999, "end": 587.28}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 587.9599999999999, "end": 588.54}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 588.74, "end": 589.0799999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 589.1999999999999, "end": 589.8}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 589.98, "end": 590.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 590.54, "end": 590.8399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 590.98, "end": 591.14}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 591.22, "end": 591.74}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 592.06, "end": 592.52}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 592.6, "end": 592.98}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 593.1, "end": 593.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 593.8399999999999, "end": 594.3}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 594.42, "end": 594.9599999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 595.06, "end": 595.6}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 595.9399999999999, "end": 596.6999999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 596.8399999999999, "end": 597.3199999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 597.4599999999999, "end": 598.16}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 598.26, "end": 598.8399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 598.9599999999999, "end": 599.3399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 599.4599999999999, "end": 600.16}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 600.28, "end": 601.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 601.1, "end": 601.8399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 601.9399999999999, "end": 602.52}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 602.64, "end": 603.0799999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 603.14, "end": 603.52}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 603.6999999999999, "end": 604.22}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 604.3199999999999, "end": 604.92}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 604.98, "end": 605.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 605.8399999999999, "end": 606.3}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 606.4399999999999, "end": 606.9599999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 607.06, "end": 607.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 607.54, "end": 608.14}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 608.22, "end": 608.86}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 608.9399999999999, "end": 609.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 609.54, "end": 610.18}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 610.3, "end": 610.9}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 610.98, "end": 611.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 611.4399999999999, "end": 612.0799999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 612.16, "end": 612.6999999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 612.8, "end": 613.28}, {"text": "Example 3.", "start": 614.28, "end": 616.64}, {"text": "Hold still.", "start": 619.76, "end": 620.6999999999999}, {"text": "You have a bee on your back.", "start": 620.88, "end": 622.1999999999999}, {"text": "Okay, hold still.", "start": 625.5, "end": 626.56}, {"text": "Great word.", "start": 626.74, "end": 627.22}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 627.4, "end": 627.52}, {"text": "All right, one final phrase for you.", "start": 628.28, "end": 630.18}, {"text": "Out of the woods.", "start": 630.4, "end": 631.42}, {"text": "Out of the woods.", "start": 631.92, "end": 633.3199999999999}, {"text": "Out of the woods.", "start": 633.54, "end": 634.22}, {"text": "Out of the woods.", "start": 634.56, "end": 635.3399999999999}, {"text": "So when someone's out of the woods, they're...", "start": 635.9, "end": 638.04}, {"text": "Free from danger.", "start": 638.04, "end": 638.8399999999999}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 639.06, "end": 639.3}, {"text": "Safe.", "start": 639.56, "end": 639.72}, {"text": "Okay, safe.", "start": 639.72, "end": 640.4}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 640.52, "end": 640.64}, {"text": "I guess it's kind of a saying.", "start": 641.06, "end": 642.5}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 642.68, "end": 642.86}, {"text": "Like, I'm out of the woods.", "start": 642.86, "end": 644.0799999999999}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 644.08, "end": 644.2800000000001}, {"text": "I'm free.", "start": 644.46, "end": 645.6}, {"text": "I'm safe.", "start": 645.8000000000001, "end": 646.5400000000001}, {"text": "I guess there are two variants of this phrase.", "start": 646.7, "end": 648.5400000000001}, {"text": "We can say, I'm out of the woods, or we're out of the woods, or I guess we're not out of the woods yet.", "start": 648.64, "end": 653.5600000000001}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 653.74, "end": 654.0600000000001}, {"text": "So, okay.", "start": 654.32, "end": 655.7}, {"text": "Out of the woods.", "start": 656.08, "end": 656.94}, {"text": "Okay, so now it's time for us to listen to our dialogue again, and when we come back, Eric is going to tell us about her ER story.", "start": 657.8000000000001, "end": 664.5600000000001}, {"text": "Help!", "start": 664.56, "end": 666.56}, {"text": "Are you a doctor?", "start": 666.56, "end": 676.52}, {"text": "My poor little Frankie has just stopped breathing.", "start": 676.52, "end": 679.4}, {"text": "Oh my gosh, help me.", "start": 679.7199999999999, "end": 681.02}, {"text": "I tried to perform CPR, but I just, I don't know if I could get any air into his lungs.", "start": 681.4, "end": 685.2399999999999}, {"text": "Oh, Frankie!", "start": 685.38, "end": 686.2199999999999}, {"text": "Frankie!", "start": 686.22, "end": 686.4200000000001}, {"text": "Helen, get him hooked up to a monitor.", "start": 687.22, "end": 689.1}, {"text": "Somebody page Dr. Hauser!", "start": 689.6800000000001, "end": 690.86}, {"text": "Get the patient hold still.", "start": 691.48, "end": 692.44}, {"text": "I can't get a pulse.", "start": 693.5400000000001, "end": 694.5600000000001}, {"text": "Okay, he's on the monitor.", "start": 696.74, "end": 697.86}, {"text": "His BP's falling.", "start": 698.44, "end": 699.28}, {"text": "He's flatlining.", "start": 699.82, "end": 700.48}, {"text": "No!", "start": 700.9, "end": 701.24}, {"text": "Frankie!", "start": 702.5400000000001, "end": 702.9}, {"text": "Doctor, do something!", "start": 703.74, "end": 704.98}, {"text": "Someone get her out of here.", "start": 704.98, "end": 707.22}, {"text": "Get me the defibrillator.", "start": 707.76, "end": 708.94}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 709.5600000000001, "end": 709.8000000000001}, {"text": "Clear.", "start": 710.5, "end": 710.86}, {"text": "Again, clear.", "start": 712.34, "end": 713.26}, {"text": "Come on, dammit, I'm not letting go of you.", "start": 714.52, "end": 716.24}, {"text": "Clear!", "start": 716.64, "end": 717.12}, {"text": "I got a pulse?", "start": 718.7, "end": 719.48}, {"text": "Okay, what's happening?", "start": 720.12, "end": 721.1}, {"text": "Patient is in acute respiratory failure.", "start": 721.62, "end": 723.48}, {"text": "I think we're going to have to intubate.", "start": 723.58, "end": 724.9}, {"text": "Alright, tube's in.", "start": 725.6800000000001, "end": 726.96}, {"text": "Bag him.", "start": 727.2, "end": 727.52}, {"text": "Somebody give him 10 cc shot of adrenaline.", "start": 727.82, "end": 729.72}, {"text": "Let's go, people, move, move!", "start": 730.16, "end": 732.1}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 734.98, "end": 739.4200000000001}, {"text": "Oh, thank God!", "start": 739.6800000000001, "end": 740.84}, {"text": "How is he?", "start": 741.0600000000001, "end": 742.22}, {"text": "We've managed to stabilize Frankie, but he's not out of the woods yet.", "start": 742.76, "end": 746.6}, {"text": "He's still in critical condition.", "start": 747.2, "end": 748.72}, {"text": "We're moving him to intensive care, but...", "start": 749.44, "end": 751.6}, {"text": "Doctor!", "start": 751.6, "end": 752.0}, {"text": "Just do whatever it takes.", "start": 752.52, "end": 754.5}, {"text": "I just want my little Frankie to be okay.", "start": 754.5, "end": 756.6800000000001}, {"text": "I couldn't imagine life without my little hamster.", "start": 757.28, "end": 760.34}, {"text": "Okay, Erica, so what happened?", "start": 765.78, "end": 766.98}, {"text": "What emergency did you have?", "start": 767.08, "end": 768.4200000000001}, {"text": "Well, it was with my cat.", "start": 768.76, "end": 769.9}, {"text": "Your cat.", "start": 770.1, "end": 770.64}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 770.76, "end": 771.04}, {"text": "I had some people over for dinner, and it was maybe 1.30 in the morning, and I went downstairs", "start": 771.1800000000001, "end": 776.62}, {"text": "to let them out and show them where the taxis were, and then I came up and I saw that the", "start": 776.62, "end": 780.82}, {"text": "cat was gone, and it turned out that the cat fell out of the window.", "start": 780.82, "end": 784.6800000000001}, {"text": "Fell out of the window.", "start": 785.22, "end": 786.5600000000001}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 786.8000000000001, "end": 786.9200000000001}, {"text": "All right, but our listeners have to know, what story or what floor do you live on?", "start": 787.28, "end": 791.8399999999999}, {"text": "The 20th floor.", "start": 791.9, "end": 792.74}, {"text": "The 20th.", "start": 792.78, "end": 793.62}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 793.64, "end": 793.9599999999999}, {"text": "So this is really dangerous, right?", "start": 794.1999999999999, "end": 795.8199999999999}, {"text": "That's really high up.", "start": 795.9399999999999, "end": 796.92}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 796.92, "end": 797.06}, {"text": "So I went outside, and I was calling for my cat, and I was like, Mr. Finn, where are you?", "start": 797.9799999999999, "end": 802.18}, {"text": "How did you know he fell out?", "start": 802.28, "end": 803.26}, {"text": "I just knew.", "start": 803.36, "end": 803.9399999999999}, {"text": "Yeah?", "start": 804.18, "end": 804.4}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 804.56, "end": 804.8}, {"text": "Mother's instinct.", "start": 804.9799999999999, "end": 805.62}, {"text": "I guess so.", "start": 805.76, "end": 806.3399999999999}, {"text": "And so he was calling back to me, and so I picked him up and brought him to the house,", "start": 806.54, "end": 811.68}, {"text": "and we had to bring him to the vet, and it was 2.30, 3 in the morning at this time, and", "start": 811.68, "end": 816.3}, {"text": "the vet was not very happy that we woke him up out of bed.", "start": 816.3, "end": 819.38}, {"text": "But that was a really good emergency, though.", "start": 820.62, "end": 822.8399999999999}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 822.9, "end": 823.26}, {"text": "So anyway, we brought him to the vet.", "start": 823.52, "end": 825.66}, {"text": "He was in critical condition for a couple of days, and then we had to keep him in the", "start": 825.8199999999999, "end": 830.52}, {"text": "vet's ICU for about a week.", "start": 830.52, "end": 832.8}, {"text": "He broke his back.", "start": 833.5999999999999, "end": 834.78}, {"text": "He broke two of his legs.", "start": 835.04, "end": 837.4}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 837.88, "end": 838.24}, {"text": "Yeah, and so he was in the hospital for three weeks, and then at home on bed rest for another", "start": 838.24, "end": 843.7}, {"text": "three weeks.", "start": 843.7, "end": 844.36}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 844.58, "end": 844.92}, {"text": "But now he's good as new.", "start": 845.08, "end": 846.44}, {"text": "Good as new.", "start": 846.5600000000001, "end": 847.14}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 847.28, "end": 847.54}, {"text": "He used up one of his seven lives.", "start": 847.64, "end": 850.0600000000001}, {"text": "Nine lives.", "start": 850.34, "end": 850.74}, {"text": "Nine?", "start": 850.78, "end": 851.02}, {"text": "Nine.", "start": 851.2, "end": 851.42}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 851.5600000000001, "end": 851.8}, {"text": "I think maybe eight of his nine lives.", "start": 852.1, "end": 853.76}, {"text": "Eight.", "start": 853.76, "end": 853.98}, {"text": "He's only got one left.", "start": 854.14, "end": 855.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 855.52, "end": 855.6800000000001}, {"text": "Wow, that's an interesting story.", "start": 855.96, "end": 857.1800000000001}, {"text": "I guess that's the inspiration under this dialogue.", "start": 857.28, "end": 860.12}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 860.36, "end": 860.8}, {"text": "Sometimes we Anglos really treat our cats and our hamsters and our dogs like they're our", "start": 861.58, "end": 866.88}, {"text": "children.", "start": 866.88, "end": 867.1800000000001}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 867.64, "end": 867.94}, {"text": "No, that's good.", "start": 867.94, "end": 868.7800000000001}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 868.98, "end": 869.1600000000001}, {"text": "Well, I'm glad Mr. Finn is okay, and he's walking and good as new.", "start": 869.1800000000001, "end": 872.32}, {"text": "Yep, good as new.", "start": 872.48, "end": 873.1600000000001}, {"text": "So maybe our users have some stories about their pets.", "start": 873.4000000000001, "end": 877.44}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 877.5600000000001, "end": 877.8000000000001}, {"text": "Being taken to the hospital.", "start": 877.94, "end": 879.0600000000001}, {"text": "I want to hear.", "start": 879.24, "end": 879.72}, {"text": "Yeah, that should be interesting.", "start": 880.08, "end": 881.08}, {"text": "I've never had a pet actually break a leg or anything, so I don't have any pet stories", "start": 881.08, "end": 886.0400000000001}, {"text": "this time.", "start": 886.0400000000001, "end": 886.4200000000001}, {"text": "But we want to hear what you think, so come to EnglishPod.com, leave all your questions and", "start": 886.5200000000001, "end": 890.94}, {"text": "comments and your stories.", "start": 890.94, "end": 892.12}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 892.3000000000001, "end": 892.48}, {"text": "And we'll be there to answer them.", "start": 892.86, "end": 894.2}, {"text": "Well, guys, thanks for listening, and until next time, goodbye.", "start": 894.36, "end": 897.4000000000001}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 897.4, "end": 897.64}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 898.4599999999999, "end": 898.8199999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 899.1, "end": 899.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 899.5799999999999, "end": 899.74}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 900.02, "end": 900.22}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 900.28, "end": 900.42}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 900.5799999999999, "end": 900.92}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 901.06, "end": 901.42}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 901.52, "end": 901.9399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 901.98, "end": 902.12}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 902.3199999999999, "end": 902.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 902.56, "end": 902.9}